WEBVTT

00:01:28.371 --> 00:01:30.371
receive no votes.

00:01:31.204 --> 00:01:33.663
Do you feel that?

00:01:33.663 --> 00:01:35.496
That feeling that you have right now?

00:01:35.496 --> 00:01:38.496
The anxiety, the upset and bewilderment

00:01:38.538 --> 00:01:41.038
as to how you came to be the odd one out

00:01:41.079 --> 00:01:42.788
for just doing what you were told.

00:01:42.829 --> 00:01:44.829
To come as you are.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.538
That's exactly how I feel

00:01:47.579 --> 00:01:52.788
when I am told to bring
my full, authentic self to work.

00:01:54.538 --> 00:01:59.538
"We want people of color
to feel like they belong here," they say.

00:01:59.579 --> 00:02:03.121
"We're looking for passionate people
who can bring a fresh perspective